    <tags>cuttle converter file-converter offline right-click context-menu ffmpeg</tags>
    <summary>Offline Windows right-click file converter</summary>
    <description>
      Right-click any file, pick a format, and get a converted copy next to the original.
      100% offline, privacy-first, free and open source. Converts video, audio, images,
      office documents, PDFs, scanned OCR documents, and CAD drawings without cloud servers.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Ameya79/cuttle/releases/tag/v1.0.0</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
